I’m implementing the vault UI and backend permission checks. Invited members will use their own browser sessions; passwords will stay behind the backend.

**Now:** inspect the vault flow, add invitations and revocation, then test cross-user access. Done means only the selected member can use the selected login while the invitation is active.

